</div>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Dental Abscess</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">A pus-filled infection at the root tip of a tooth causes throbbing pain, tooth sensitivity to hot and cold, and facial swelling in the area near the affected tooth. <a href="dental-abscess-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline hover:text-primary">Dental abscess treatment</a> covers this in detail.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Cellulitis / Space Infection</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">A spreading bacterial infection through facial soft tissue causes poorly defined redness and diffuse swelling with warmth and tenderness. If the infection enters facial spaces between muscles, it causes significant facial asymmetry and trismus. <a href="facial-cellulitis-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline hover:text-primary">Facial cellulitis treatment</a> covers this.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Infected Facial Cyst</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Sebaceous and epidermal cysts on the face commonly become infected — a red, tender, warm swelling that is painful to the touch. Requires drainage and often excision to prevent recurrence. <a href="facial-abscess-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline hover:text-primary">Facial abscess treatment</a> covers this.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Salivary Gland Infection</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Obstruction or infection of a salivary gland causes painful swelling of the cheek or under the jaw. Eating triggers pain (saliva release against a blockage). May produce pus discharge into the mouth.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Insect Bite with Cellulitis</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">An insect bite on the face that becomes secondarily infected produces red, swollen, warm, tender skin. May present as a rapidly enlarging painful area. <a href="face-redness-and-swelling-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline hover:text-primary">Face redness and swelling</a> covers this.</p></div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-surface-variant"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-secondary mb-4 icon-fill-1">healing</span><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-xl text-primary mb-3">Post-Traumatic Swelling</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Fractures of the cheekbone (zygoma) or jaw (mandible) from facial trauma cause painful swelling with bruising, jaw asymmetry, and difficulty opening the mouth or biting.</p></div>
